Employees: Department.Name Department,
    COUNT(Id) Headcount,
    ROUND(AVG(Salary), <2>) AverageSalary,
    ROUND(SUM(Salary), <2>) AnnualPayroll,
    ROUND(AVG(ReviewSummary.AverageRating), <2>) AverageRating,
    ROUND(SUM(Coalesce(ReviewSummary.Bonuses, <0>)), <2>) TotalBonuses
  Order AnnualPayroll ASC
  Left Join ReviewSummary ReviewSummary On Id = ReviewSummary.EmployeeId
ReviewSummary is PerformanceReviews: EmployeeId EmployeeId, AVG(Rating) AverageRating, SUM(BonusAmount) Bonuses